! Tuan 9: POTS và E1
! Dia chi tai lieu RFC 5737/3849; thay theo topology lab rieng.
configure terminal
hostname VG1
controller E1 0/0/0
 framing CRC4
 linecode HDB3
pri-group timeslots 1-10,16
interface Serial0/0/0:15
 no shutdown
dial-peer voice 300 pots
 destination-pattern 3...
 direct-inward-dial
end
write memory
